{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26597","headline":"送狄兼謩下第归故山 · 姚合","name":"送狄兼謩下第归故山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慈恩塔上名，昨日败垂成。\n赁舍应无直，居山岂钓声。\n半年犹小隐，数日得闲行。\n映竹窥猿剧，寻云探鹤情。\n爱花高酒户，煮药污茶铛。\n莫便多时住，烟霄路在城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}